OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother bright, chilly start
OL,6,Fthis morning. Turning increasingly
OL,7,Fcloudy from the east during the
OL,8,Fafternoon, perhaps with the odd shower
OL,9,Fdeveloping later. Feeling pleasant in
OL,10,Fthose sunny spells with mostly light
OL,11,Fwinds. Temperatures around average for
OL,12,Fthe time of year.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FClear intervals and the odd
OL,15,Fshower this evening. However, cloud
OL,16,Fthickening from the east overnight
OL,17,Fwith outbreaks of rain arriving, some
OL,18,Fperhaps heavy. Feeling milder than the
OL,19,Fprevious night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
