OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FCloudy and wet to start
OL,6,FMonday, though rain becoming confined
OL,7,Fto western parts and turning more
OL,8,Fshowery. Skies brightening from the
OL,9,Feast, allowing for some sunny spells.
OL,10,FTemperatures around average.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,13,FUnsettled with outbreaks of rain
OL,14,Fdeveloping at times on Tuesday into
OL,15,FWednesday. Some brighter spells around
OL,16,Fon Thursday, though with showers too.
OL,17,FBecoming windy, with coastal gales
OL,18,Fpossible, especially later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
